Z||000007||Racer 1||05-08-2000||10:59 PM||||The mods I did to my <B>DUCK</B> is hooker header super comp tri-Y header. I polished my TBI by hand myself throat and butterfly. I can forsee a QUAD-4 HO install here in a little bit. You can only squeeze so much juice before adding to much money. Get the hooker header though I noticed alot more bottom-mid and top end with the header. ||||reg||10
